          %p
            The notion of
            %em well-founded coalgebra
            is due to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Taylor"} Paul Taylor
            (with antecedents in the work of Gerhard Osius). Our account is largely based on (
            %a{:href => "#Taylor99"}> Taylor, section 6.3)
            ), and on his paper
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#tTaylor96"} The General Recursion Theorem
